      <div>
        <span class="demo-eyebrow">Hail history</span>
        <h2 class="demo-h2">Why the Front Range insurance market has its own roofing culture.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--rc-text-muted);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Colorado Springs sits inside one of the most active severe-hail corridors in North America. The 2018, 2023, and 2024 seasons each produced billion-dollar hail events along the Front Range. Most homeowners in our service area will file an insurance claim for roof damage at least once per decade.</p>

        <div style="padding:1.5rem;background:var(--demo-charcoal);color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:6px">
