            <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)"><strong style="color:var(--rc-red)">Aug 2024</strong> &middot; baseball-sized hail, east side</li>
            <li style="padding:0.5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)"><strong style="color:var(--rc-red)">Jun 2023</strong> &middot; wind + hail, Black Forest to Monument</li>
